          "type": "text",
          "text": "Imagine reaching the start of a mountain trail and needing a guide who knows the route."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A confident guide stands before you, but a confident voice leaves some questions unanswered."
        }
      ],
      "question": [
